zabbix_export:
  version: '7.0'
  template_groups:
    - uuid: cb0888acc0434db7a49a67941eb4657c
      name: 'Templates/Network devices'
  templates:
    - uuid: 22e87f7d86694a5fbe0104546b1be0c1
      template: 'HPE Networking Instant On 1930 CPU Utilization'
      name: 'HPE Networking Instant On 1930 CPU Utilization'
      description: |
        HPE Networking Instant On 1930 serisi (ör. JL684B) icin CPU/Memory
        izleme sablonu. SNMP arayuzu proxy uzerinden zaten calisiyor.
        
        CPU Utilization: rlCpuUtilDuringLast5Minutes (RADLAN-turevi
        HPE-rndMng-MIB, OID .1.3.6.1.4.1.11.2.1.9.0). Bu MIB dalinin tam
        nesne listesi dogrulandi - CPU icin 4 nesne var (Enable,
        LastSecond, LastMinute, Last5Minutes), aktif olan bu.
        
        Memory Utilization: Ayni MIB dalinda memory'e karsilik gelen HICBIR
        nesne yok (39 nesnelik tam liste kontrol edildi). Yani bu cihaz
        ailesinde SNMP ile memory okumak icin bir OID donanimda/yazilimda
        mevcut degil - config/erisim sorunu degil. Item bu yuzden pasif
        birakildi; gercek bir OID ortaya cikarsa (firmware guncellemesiyle
        vs.) buraya eklenir.
      groups:
        - name: 'Templates/Network devices'
      items:
        - uuid: 49af663cd76e4dd48fb49a7660ff528a
          name: 'CPU Utilization'
          type: SNMP_AGENT
          snmp_oid: 1.3.6.1.4.1.11.2.1.9.0
          key: cpu.utilization
          delay: 5m
          history: 7d
          value_type: FLOAT
          units: '%'
          description: |
            HPE-rndMng-MIB::rlCpuUtilDuringLast5Minutes
            Son 5 dakikalik ortalama CPU kullanimi (%).
          tags:
            - tag: component
              value: cpu
        - uuid: e82cd740f4bb4111975bf2b0452d021e
          name: 'Memory Utilization'
          type: SNMP_AGENT
          snmp_oid: 1.3.6.1.2.1.1.3.0
          key: memory.utilization
          delay: 5m
          history: 7d
          value_type: FLOAT
          status: DISABLED
          units: '%'
          description: |
            Bu cihaz ailesinin SNMP MIB'inde memory nesnesi yok, dogrulandi.
            OID alani su an sysUpTime (1.3.6.1.2.1.1.3.0) - bilerek
            anlamsiz bir deger, yanlislikla enable edilip CPU ile
            karisan yanlis veri gormeyin diye. Gercek OID bulununca
            guncellenip enable edilecek.
          tags:
            - tag: component
              value: memory
